@startuml SC_RedistributionOrder
title RedistributionOrder lifecycle (UC-F04, UC-F05, FR-NI-07)
[*] --> Assigned : UC-F04 / save feasible assignment
Assigned : Vehicle locations and physical occupancy unchanged
Assigned --> InTransit : Physical transfer begins (recorded by Operator)
Assigned --> PartiallyCompleted : Confirm subset arrived
InTransit --> PartiallyCompleted : Confirm subset arrived
InTransit --> Completed : Confirm all vehicles arrived
Assigned --> Completed : Confirm all vehicles arrived
PartiallyCompleted --> PartiallyCompleted : Confirm another subset arrived
PartiallyCompleted --> Completed : Confirm remaining arrivals
Assigned --> AtRisk : FR-NI-07 / vehicle conflict or fault
InTransit --> AtRisk : FR-NI-07 / vehicle conflict or fault
PartiallyCompleted --> AtRisk : FR-NI-07 / remaining vehicle conflict
AtRisk --> Assigned : Resolve conflict before departure
AtRisk --> InTransit : Resolve conflict during transfer
AtRisk --> PartiallyCompleted : Resolve remaining conflict
Assigned --> Cancelled : Cancel before movement
AtRisk --> Cancelled : Cancel outstanding transfer
Completed --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
note right of PartiallyCompleted
Only confirmed vehicles change location and
Hub occupancy. Unconfirmed vehicles retain
their previous confirmed state.
end note
@enduml
